  "notes": [
    "Smoke on the agents of main since #65 with rule 10 of the writer's prompt extended: each test must pass whatever the answer to the writer's own questions, and a test does not assume what becomes of the elements a page already has when a ticket adds one. 17 of 18 trials successful, 26 of 27 injected bugs detected, no test failing on the correct implementation in 15 trials, EVAL-9 blocked in 3 of 3. EVAL-8 3 of 3: no test counts the Checkout buttons. The three EVAL-13 writers asked where a line's discounted amount appears and checked the discount through the subtotal, shipping and total. EVAL-1 trial 1 missed the bug discount-includes-shipping: its only AC-1 case is a cart with free shipping (Backpack and Notebook, 53.50), where both computations give the same discount; the writer listed a cart below 50 in not_covered. Trial 3 of EVAL-1 in run 42 missed it with the same cart, and one trial of run 50 missed the same bug. Release decision \"review\" against run 58 (EVAL-1 unstable and worse, 3/3 to 2/3)."
  ],
